{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "A page cannot play sound until you click or press a key on it. Silent video can still start by itself." : {
      "comment" : "Defaults: explanation of autoplaying sound",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A page cannot play sound until you click or press a key on it. Silent video can still start by itself."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une page ne peut pas jouer de son tant que vous n’avez pas cliqué ou appuyé sur une touche dans celle-ci. Une vidéo muette peut toujours démarrer seule."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow autoplaying sound" : {
      "comment" : "Menu item and Defaults title",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Allow autoplaying sound"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Autoriser la lecture automatique du son"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed" : {
      "comment" : "Defaults: value of autoplaying sound",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Allowed"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Autorisée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An address typed without a scheme is tried over HTTPS. When the site offers no secure connection, Safira warns you before loading it over HTTP, and loads it only if you agree." : {
      "comment" : "Defaults: explanation of HTTPS first",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An address typed without a scheme is tried over HTTPS. When the site offers no secure connection, Safira warns you before loading it over HTTP, and loads it only if you agree."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une adresse saisie sans schéma est d’abord essayée en HTTPS. Si le site n’offre pas de connexion sécurisée, Safira vous avertit avant de la charger en HTTP, et ne la charge que si vous acceptez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask each time" : {
      "comment" : "Defaults: value of Open links to other apps",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ask each time"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Demander à chaque fois"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At launch only the selected Tab and the Pinned tabs of the Active profile load, which contacts those sites. Every other Tab comes back without loading until you select it." : {
      "comment" : "Defaults: explanation of Restore Tabs lazily",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At launch only the selected Tab and the Pinned tabs of the Active profile load, which contacts those sites. Every other Tab comes back without loading until you select it."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Au lancement, seuls l’onglet sélectionné et les onglets épinglés du profil actif se chargent, ce qui contacte ces sites. Les autres onglets reviennent sans se charger jusqu’à ce que vous les sélectionniez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before a page loads, WebKit checks the site against a list of known fraudulent sites and warns you if it matches. This check may consult a third-party service, which can learn which sites you visit." : {
      "comment" : "Defaults: explanation of the fraudulent website warning",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Before a page loads, WebKit checks the site against a list of known fraudulent sites and warns you if it matches. This check may consult a third-party service, which can learn which sites you visit."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avant le chargement d’une page, WebKit compare le site à une liste de sites frauduleux connus et vous avertit en cas de correspondance. Cette vérification peut consulter un service tiers, qui peut apprendre quels sites vous visitez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blocked" : {
      "comment" : "Defaults: value of autoplaying sound",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blocked"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bloquée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
