          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warn about fraudulent websites" : {
      "comment" : "Menu item and Defaults title",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Warn about fraudulent websites"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avertir en cas de site web frauduleux"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Web inspector" : {
      "comment" : "Defaults: entry title",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Web inspector"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inspecteur web"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you type in the Command bar is not sent to a search engine to complete it. Suggestions come from the Active profile's history and open Tabs, on this Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Defaults: explanation of Remote search suggestions",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you type in the Command bar is not sent to a search engine to complete it. Suggestions come from the Active profile's history and open Tabs, on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce que vous tapez dans la barre de commande n’est pas envoyé à un moteur de recherche pour le compléter. Les suggestions viennent de l’historique et des onglets ouverts du profil actif, sur ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a page opens a link that only another app can take, such as mailto: or slack:, Safira names the app and asks first. You can remember the answer for a Profile and a scheme, and forget it again." : {
      "comment" : "Defaults: explanation of Open links to other apps",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a page opens a link that only another app can take, such as mailto: or slack:, Safira names the app and asks first. You can remember the answer for a Profile and a scheme, and forget it again."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quand une page ouvre un lien que seule une autre app peut prendre en charge, comme mailto: ou slack:, Safira nomme l’app et demande d’abord. Vous pouvez mémoriser la réponse pour un profil et un schéma, puis l’oublier."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}